[[File:E 360.png|thumb|[[Shibalien Elite|Shibalien Elite]], the first example of a Starred Alien enemy]]
'''Starred Alien Enemies''' are an [[Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]] subtype introduced in Chapter 1 of [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. They count as [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]] and thus are affected by [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien Cats]], but they have unique characteristics in the form of [[Special Abilities|abilities]], as they generally tend to have [[Warp]] and/or [[Barrier]] abilities, with the only exception being [[Filibuster Obstructa]]. Design-wise, all of them have a yellow star on a part of their body.

Starred Aliens' stats are multiplied by 1600% default, and are unaffected by the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] of [[Into the Future]]. However, Cats of the Cosmos has many of its own [[Treasure]]s that reduce the power of Starred Aliens. Like the Into the Future Treasures, each 100% [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures|Anti-Starred Alien Treasure]] reduces their power by 100%.

